  "as_of": "2019-12-04",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would transfer collection of business name registry fees to the appointed registrar as part of the wider Commonwealth business registers modernisation package.",
   "It would change the government body receiving fees for registry functions, while retaining the existing fee arrangements and amounts charged for particular services.",
   "It would accompany the Commonwealth Registers Bill and other registry amendments, which establish the wider system and allocate registry functions to an appointed registrar."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "Business name registration fees associated with transferred registry functions would be collected by the registrar.",
   "Business name renewal fees for those functions would also be collected by the registrar.",
   "Collection of related late fees would move with the relevant registry functions."
  ],
  "affected": "Business name applicants and holders, the Australian Securities and Investments Commission and the appointed registrar are affected.",
